From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rui Figueira <rfigueira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 19:50:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Paint tables from adjusted track geometry

Read the per-resolve paint copy of table tracks so collapsed borders
stay aligned without destroying Taffy's raw metadata. Table row
backgrounds do not read the tracks: upstream paints them per cell from
the cells' own layout.
---
 src/render/border.rs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/render/border.rs b/src/render/border.rs
index f4dd98f..74b75f2 100644
--- a/src/render/border.rs
+++ b/src/render/border.rs
@@ -523,7 +523,7 @@ impl ElementCx<'_, '_> {
             return;
         }

-        let Some(grid_info) = &mut *table.computed_grid_info.borrow_mut() else {
+        let Some(grid_info) = &*table.paint_grid_info.borrow() else {
             return;
         };
         let Some(border_style) = table.border_style.as_deref() else {
